Package: pulsaros-effects-settings
Version: 1.0.64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Description: Desktop effects switcher for Pulsar OS.
 Allows toggling between Blur my Shell and Liquid Glass (acrylic glassmorphism)
 and automatically configures Dash to Dock settings for optimal rendering.
